.card-header.bordered
  h2 Free Cloud Machine

.card-body.centered

  .visual
    .sparks-combo
      .spark
      .spark
      .spark
      .spark
      .spark
      .spark
      .spark

    .wave-a.hot.rainbow
    .wave-a.cold.rainbow
    .wave-b.hot.rainbow
    .wave-b.cold.rainbow

    .happy-nitrous
      .happy-face


  .content-wrapper
    h2
      | You've been added to the waitlist!

    h3.waitlist
      | We're working hard to catch up with an overwhelming demand for free workspaces. We'll email you as soon as your workspace is ready.

    p.bigger
      | We'd love to hear more about how you intend to use Nitrous Pro and leverage our cloud platform.

    a.btn.tweet.outline.duo href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=I%27m%20ditching%20localhost%20for%20the%20cloud%2C%20sign%20up%20for%20%40nitrousio%20today!%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nitrous.io" target="_blank"
      i.fa.fa-twitter
      span Tweet

    a.btn.survey.outline.duo href=view.wufooURL target="_blank"
      i.fa.fa-check-square-o
      span Take the survey



    .box-wrapper
      .box
        h3 What is Nitrous Pro
        p
          ' We built Nitrous Pro, our new collaborative development platform, from the experiences of over 200,000 developers. Nitrous Pro brings a variety of improvements to our IDE, desktop application and real-time collaboration.
          a href="/whatsnew" target="blank" Read about
          |  the updates.

      .box
        h3 Why a waiting list?
        p
          | Building dedicated, lightning-fast development environments for thousands of users is a difficult technological problem. Our goal is to ensure your experience is faster and more stable than your own computer. Therefore, we need to thoughtfully control the number of new workspaces being created.

      .box
        h3 How long do I have to wait?
        p
          ' We are working incredibly hard to meet demand for our new cloud workspaces and will let in as many free users as we can each day. If you'd like to skip the line, you can create a paid workspace
          a href='#' click=cancel without waiting
          | .
